ic power could power steam distillation or reverse osmosis. Hydroelectric power would be used to split H2. All machinery would be powered by Hydroelectric power. H2O source would come from same source as hydroelectric power reservoir. H2 would be extracted from same water source. This is a closed system which produces tritium without phage virus contamination, pycnogonida, or spider crabs.","topics":[],"score":175773,"global_rank":436764},{"name":"JakeSquier/learn-co-sandbox","owner":"JakeSquier","html_url":"https://github.com/JakeSquier/learn-co-sandbox","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":175770,"global_rank":436765},{"name":"jt96/helloworld","owner":"jt96","html_url":"https://github.com/jt96/helloworld","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"simple hello world web app","topics":[],"score":175770,"global_rank":436766},{"name":"hakhuong/IMDB-ratings-prediction","owner":"hakhuong","html_url":"https://github.com/hakhuong/IMDB-ratings-prediction","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Data from 5000 movies on IMDB","topics":[],"score":175770,"global_rank":436767},{"name":"PerrySong/learnDataflow","owner":"PerrySong","html_url":"https://github.com/PerrySong/learnDataflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Repo to Learn Dataflow","topics":[],"score":175770,"global_rank":436768},{"name":"jimmy12day/Fun","owner":"jimmy12day","html_url":"https://github.com/jimmy12day/Fun","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":175770,"global_rank":436769},{"name":"LumineerLabs/Lumimote","owner":"LumineerLabs","html_url":"https://github.com/LumineerLabs/Lumimote","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"A Wi-Fi and BT enabled LED driver for the ESP32. It will connect to configured 802.11 access points or mes